{
"file": 472,
"paths": [
"d008/d024/f014",
"d008/d024/f038"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "07c40cbe",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ed42cc0c",
"en_raw": "Hey, is that of yours a performance?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "461c6148",
"en_raw": "Does it look like one?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "e5d1aa6d",
"en_raw": "Illness, right"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "2a480d6d",
"en_raw": "Then I suppose it is"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "28c2fb88",
"en_raw": "May I give my impression?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "cf30ffeb",
"en_raw": "Go ahead"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "e2caad0e",
"en_raw": "Unchanging, boring"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "25fd71c4",
"en_raw": "Thank you"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "2aa18f4e",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "d4ac48d0",
"en_raw": "Every day, every day, every day"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "a3d0b061",
"en_raw": "you do nothing but the same thing"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "6e88504b",
"en_raw": "though nobody is watching anymore"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "4e0ecdca",
"en_raw": "like flowing water"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "186232f6",
"en_raw": "you waste your life"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "40fd8d29",
"en_raw": "That's what you think now, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "71440534",
"en_raw": "...A super-power user?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "2aa18f4e",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "a5975641",
"en_raw": "about the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "db6468a5",
"en_raw": "Are you and I"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f155a901",
"en_raw": "acquaintances?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "8deb2f08",
"en_raw": "I think I can say we are"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f8f15212",
"en_raw": "I don't know your name, though"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b575ae92",
"en_raw": "...Sango, that's my name"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "212493a0",
"en_raw": "Sango, do you need something?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "cd3ab834",
"en_raw": "Since we're acquaintances"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "14e80e43",
"en_raw": "can I vent?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "cf30ffeb",
"en_raw": "Go ahead"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "6ccb391d",
"en_raw": "There's a guy who pisses me off"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f76563fa",
"en_raw": "so much I want to kill him"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "a63e7ba2",
"en_raw": "You know what the word"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0e214880",
"en_raw": "'kill' means, right?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "dcda4fdc",
"en_raw": "Do you want to be angry?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "191b3847",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e29602f2",
"en_raw": "Then listen seriously"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3176c7ad",
"en_raw": "Then I won't"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "11998dd0",
"en_raw": "recommend killing"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "da97ac1b",
"en_raw": "Murder doesn't scare me"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "ac166af0",
"en_raw": "but he's someone I absolutely can't kill"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "fe04d518",
"en_raw": "And why is that?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "fe41a5f8",
"en_raw": "...Don't you get it?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "a85d797e",
"en_raw": "You're not a super-power user, after all"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "b511cc2d",
"en_raw": "I was hoping"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "02aa0b74",
"en_raw": "Well, if one thing is clear"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "a37277d8",
"en_raw": "it's that Sango is"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "7a8fdd81",
"en_raw": "sleeping normally"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "178b70b3",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, normally!"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "1817e65d",
"en_raw": "Day after day"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "08b07326",
"en_raw": "all you do is spin a stick"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "b9002bb1",
"en_raw": "where does your sense of normal"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "e14e24d1",
"en_raw": "even come from!"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "a8f3c3e5",
"en_raw": "You're right"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "7f8a338f",
"en_raw": "I'm..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "995f331a",
"en_raw": "Anyway, you shouldn't"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "bb8d6d99",
"en_raw": "show emotion in a place like this"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "b95323a3",
"en_raw": "This is a public place"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "71019ede",
"en_raw": "you see"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "08e171c4",
"en_raw": "And before you kill"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "6bbe6fa8",
"en_raw": "it's better to think carefully"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "5a320a91",
"en_raw": "So who I want to kill is..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "174bd408",
"en_raw": "Sango is a strong kid"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "6a84a9c5",
"en_raw": "If you can kill with that strength"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b408f9c6",
"en_raw": "then kill"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "79c10599",
"en_raw": "But you must remember"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "af7e76f2",
"en_raw": "that person is also an important"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "5159fc71",
"en_raw": "part of Sango"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "84d93507",
"en_raw": "I was wrong to meet you..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "9740fa07",
"en_raw": "That was a terrible thing to say"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "71e1fc1a",
"en_raw": "Hey..."
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "2c1b0330",
"en_raw": "Hey, may I ask something?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "ab31ff8a",
"en_raw": "Hey, I said"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "4ca11e5f",
"en_raw": "You're noisy"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "62423e0d",
"en_raw": "I'll bury you, damn it!"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "ccffcd45",
"en_raw": "That's a harsh thing to say"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "b6b3301e",
"en_raw": "...Oh, looking closely"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "3aa5a47f",
"en_raw": "you're a girl"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "6296302d",
"en_raw": "If it looks that way to you"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "8c9d7a2d",
"en_raw": "is probably it, right?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "45bdc0c1",
"en_raw": "Sorry, sorry"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "fe26d890",
"en_raw": "I'm not angry, I'm not angry"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "b548905c",
"en_raw": "Lately middle school brats"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "8b7f3b61",
"en_raw": "keep bothering me"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "7a0982f8",
"en_raw": "so I decided to ignore them"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "135f4cfa",
"en_raw": "Girls are fine"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "94450f40",
"en_raw": "Girls have to help each other"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "2db83887",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "b2f687a2",
"en_raw": "Even so, at first"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "3bcc9799",
"en_raw": "you said something harsh"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "cfdc8f0b",
"en_raw": "That's why, I said I was bad"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "5f72aa1b",
"en_raw": "As an apology, here's advice"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "ce01951f",
"en_raw": "for getting rid of misunderstandings"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "21bf3e73",
"en_raw": "...What is it?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "95b894f3",
"en_raw": "LV1"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "81dc55eb",
"en_raw": "Don't forget your sex appeal"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "9b6294e8",
"en_raw": "LV2"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d5389eeb",
"en_raw": "Make full use of being a woman"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "3b1079cc",
"en_raw": "LV3..."
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "f2e98d76",
"en_raw": "It's a little dangerous from here"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "ba529fa7",
"en_raw": "so I can't teach you yet"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "caa28add",
"en_raw": "That"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "359ebee1",
"en_raw": "and"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "5d2d59a6",
"en_raw": "corrections too"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "6d007a9e",
"en_raw": "will be done in no time"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "960715a7",
"en_raw": "Right, do your best!"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "1c95e5eb",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "7997fb28",
"en_raw": "For girls, experience points are what count"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "1c95e5eb",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "64ba72b4",
"en_raw": "Yahoo, girl!"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "71bd41af",
"en_raw": "Experience points,"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "6e3e6292",
"en_raw": "are you earning?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "1c95e5eb",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "442b894b",
"en_raw": "What are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "4eecda24",
"en_raw": "Sorry about that"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "76ae126f",
"en_raw": "I'm busy right now"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "30b8bd4d",
"en_raw": "Busy..."
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "8bec56e0",
"en_raw": "Listen, I'm, uh,"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "5d527989",
"en_raw": "maybe pregnant"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "3764adad",
"en_raw": "so I have no time for that"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "ddfb7080",
"en_raw": "My party is in big trouble"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "b8ec8816",
"en_raw": "Are you okay?"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "9b219807",
"en_raw": "...Stuck inside a rock!?"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "44a2b4d9",
"en_raw": "...What's that?"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "957f52c7",
"en_raw": "...Wiped out"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "2ce4c311",
"en_raw": "Feeling down?"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "22ce61e8",
"en_raw": "...Is that what they call being dumbstruck?"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "1a5bb070",
"en_raw": "It's sudden, but"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "33bf4542",
"en_raw": "will you listen to my story?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "60779806",
"en_raw": "Hey, what's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "6ffef303",
"en_raw": "Sure?"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "407f36a1",
"en_raw": "Next-gen hardware, say,"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "2e22ed07",
"en_raw": "the new"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "b51c457a",
"en_raw": "bullet train, say,"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "e19b28c2",
"en_raw": "electronic money, say,"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "c5420efb",
"en_raw": "cloning"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "b90b5506",
"en_raw": "technology, say,"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "ab18e30c",
"en_raw": "all"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "20cd78c9",
"en_raw": "welcome, I tell you"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "6053314d",
"en_raw": "...When I was little"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "7c6271db",
"en_raw": "Super-conduct-"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "a441ada2",
"en_raw": "-ing, that sound"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "00ed9caf",
"en_raw": "I was drawn to, you see~"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "30e8cc25",
"en_raw": "What about it?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "ff25f3e4",
"en_raw": "I, you see"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "8090a5b9",
"en_raw": "deeply respect master-grade human"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "233187b8",
"en_raw": "technology"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "9375e206",
"en_raw": "I respect it a lot, you see"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "e219ab89",
"en_raw": "...Nuclear tests and nuclear plants"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "afa6026a",
"en_raw": "seem a bit risky, but"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "04e9e04b",
"en_raw": "What's this about, in short?"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "1abd4a4c",
"en_raw": "And then, along with that"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "25e84bf5",
"en_raw": "what pops up"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "d84b358a",
"en_raw": "is that humanity will perish"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "ef3ce363",
"en_raw": "that negative story"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "b36b3416",
"en_raw": "Just hearing someone in a bar"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "34960298",
"en_raw": "talk about that"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "7054ad58",
"en_raw": "my heart pounds"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "c5f8936b",
"en_raw": "and I can't sleep..."
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "8017ebf3",
"en_raw": "So you want to ask what I think?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "9b1a554d",
"en_raw": "Yes, I want to ask"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "5b9225a5",
"en_raw": "...I mean"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "349093d3",
"en_raw": "It's the kind of thing"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "b9ef6711",
"en_raw": "adults agonize over"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "98b96712",
"en_raw": "Great, the best"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "b369e783",
"en_raw": "Thanks, I feel better"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "1c95e5eb",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "545b8bf8",
"en_raw": "The 21st"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "b1115cf2",
"en_raw": "century is Egypt, after all"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "08b74980",
"en_raw": "You're a middle schooler?"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "c3fa3b00",
"en_raw": "A portrait is 500 yen"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "25a089c6",
"en_raw": "Oh, no thanks"
}
]
}